Where these files travel: LICENSE and NOTICE are packaged into the application
jar (META-INF/editora/), so every build carries them; the Linux tarball, the
AppImage and the experimental Native Image archives also carry them as plain
files, and the .deb/.rpm/.msi installers are built with LICENSE as their
licence file. Each bundled font family ships its own OFL.txt beside the font
