================================================================================
Experimental Native Image archives only (-Pnative)
================================================================================

The Editora-<version>-<target>-native-experimental archives are linked with two
additional libraries that no other build uses:

JavaFX static libraries for GraalVM — us.hebi.graalvm:jfx-static-libs
    The OpenJFX native libraries built as static archives, linked into the
    native executable.
    License: GPL-2.0-with-classpath-exception (the OpenJFX licence)
    https://github.com/HebiRobotics/jfx-static-feature

jfx-static-feature — us.hebi.graalvm:jfx-static-feature
    The GraalVM Native Image feature that registers those static libraries.
    License: GPL-2.0-with-classpath-exception
    https://github.com/HebiRobotics/jfx-static-feature

The executable also contains the parts of the Java runtime that GraalVM Native
Image compiled in. Those are covered by the licence of the GraalVM distribution
the archive was built with (the release workflow uses Oracle GraalVM for
JDK 25; the OpenJDK class library is GPL-2.0-with-classpath-exception).
